<title>JAPAN: MOF to brief media on DKB's bond underwriting.</title>
<headline>MOF to brief media on DKB's bond underwriting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) will hold a media briefing from 4.30 p.m. (0730 GMT) on Wednesday on the issue of Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd's underwriting of Japanese government bonds (JGBs) and on the bank's participation in JGB auctions, a MOF spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
